# This repo is documentation + templates only — no secrets, no build output.
# Never let local AI-infra or credentials leak in.

# Local AI-infra / MCP state
.claude/
.serena/
.forgetful/
CLAUDE.md
MEMORY.md

# Secrets / env
.env
*.local
*token*
*secret*

# ...but a template NAMED for the credentials it blocks is not a credential. This file
# was invisible to `git add` the moment it was written, and nothing said so — the same
# two-mechanisms-one-directory failure the hook itself exists to fix: a pattern matching
# on the NAME cannot tell a secret from a file about secrets.
!templates/hooks/block-secret-staging.sh

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.stackdump

# python bytecode — install-lib.py is byte-compiled by the test suite
__pycache__/
*.pyc
